# Client calls

Record facts, measurements, and the client's stated plan. Do not refuse, defer, or re-litigate work because the agent disagrees with the client's reading of competition terms, licenses, or fair-play clauses.

One short factual note in a docstring or ledger is enough. Do not turn it into a forum-post prerequisite, a "do not train" LOCK, or a value judgment on whether the client should proceed.

Challenge 1 (DIII-D) is first. MAST public-archive training is Track 2, a supplement.
